  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.VNv96dJPi0WXKSFN]{Scrounger's Glee}</p><p>Your frightened condition can't be reduced below 1 while the spell is active and you can hear its caster.</p><p>The caster can Dismiss the spell as a reaction when an ally critically succeeds at a Strike against you, restoring Hit Points to that ally: (rank ÷ 2, rounded up)d4. During play, the caster is asked when that happens.</p><p>Applied with the Apply button on a failed Will save against the spell, along with the frightened condition, which goes down as usual until it reaches 1. The effect ends when the spell isn't Sustained.</p>"
